# Module Boundaries

## Project Structure
```
financialAPPcursor/
  backend/    — Spring Boot API (Java 21, Maven)
  frontend/   — React 19 + TypeScript + Vite
  docs/       — Spec, Design Doc, SDLC state (READ-ONLY during build)
```

## Backend Package Layout
```
com.artha
  ├── config/       — Spring configuration classes
  ├── domain/       — JPA entities + enums
  ├── repository/   — Spring Data JPA repositories
  ├── dto/          — Java records for request/response
  ├── service/      — Business logic services
  ├── engine/       — Stateless calculation engines
  ├── advisor/      — Rule interface + implementations
  │   ├── rules/    — Individual rule classes
  │   └── ai/       — AI explainer service
  ├── controller/   — REST controllers
  └── import_/      — CSV/CAS import services
```

## Rules
- **Controllers** call **Services** only (never Repositories directly)
- **Services** call **Repositories** and **Engines**
- **Engines** are pure static/stateless — no Spring dependencies, no DB access
- **DTOs** are Java records — never entities in API responses
- **Never modify `docs/SPEC-v1.md`** without explicit user approval
- **Database migrations** go in `backend/src/main/resources/db/migration/V{N}__*.sql`
